        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, we acquired a joint venture arrangement with SmartCentres Real Estate Investment Trust, an unaffiliated third party (“SmartCentres”), pursuant to which we and SmartCentres work together to identify primarily self storage development opportunities in certain regions in Canada.",
        "start_character": 10245,
        "end_character": 10534
      },
      {
