        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082573-99eb0985a4bbfab2",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082573",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Further, from professional development opportunities to leadership training, we have development programs and on-demand opportunities to cultivate talent throughout our organization.",
        "start_character": 26560,
        "end_character": 26742
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082573",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082573-99eb0985a4bbfab2",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082573",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Immediately after the Reverse Stock Split, we reclassified and designated 225,000,000 authorized but unissued shares of Class A Common Stock and 340,000,000 authorized but unissued shares of Class T Common Stock as authorized but unissued shares of common stock, $0.001 par value per share (the “Reclassification”), without any designation as to class or series.",
        "start_character": 15434,
        "end_character": 15796
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082573",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082573-99eb0985a4bbfab2",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082573",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "On July 18, 2024, we entered into a joint venture arrangement with an unaffiliated third party to develop a self storage property in Nantucket, Massachusetts (the “Nantucket Joint Venture”).",
        "start_character": 10703,
        "end_character": 10893
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082573",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082573-99eb0985a4bbfab2",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082573",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also appreciate the importance of retention, growth and development of our employees and we believe we offer competitive compensation (including salary and bonuses) and benefits packages to our employees.",
        "start_character": 26352,
        "end_character": 26559
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-082573",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-082573-99eb0985a4bbfab2",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-082573",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We execute our external growth strategy by developing, redeveloping, acquiring and managing self storage facilities in the United States and Canada both internally and through our Managed Platform, and we look to acquire properties that are physically stabilized, recently developed, in various stages of lease up or at certificate of occupancy.",
